<title>USA: Pearland EDC, Texas, won by First Southwest.</title>
<headline>Pearland EDC, Texas, won by First Southwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest said it won $5 million of Pearland Economic Development Corp., Texas, sales tax revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.605 percent.</p>
</text>
